# A public Mapbox token (pk.*) enables Mapbox satellite imagery, Mapbox
# geocoding, and "Detect roof" (building footprints from Mapbox Streets tiles).
# Without it the app uses Esri imagery + Photon/Nominatim and manual drawing.
# Restrict the token to your domains at https://account.mapbox.com/
VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=
